  "body": "After updating my personal HS to 0.14, I experience strange behaviour in my clients: Android’s Matrix Console shows me a room with user names as its name, while Vector web shows I’m joined to #matrix:matrix.org, even though I have left it weeks ago.\n\nUpon “opening” the room, the Android Console is just loading and loading, failing to display any events after minutes; vector-web, on the other hand, shows me recent(ish) events, even though I’m pretty sure I don’t receive everything.\n\nWhen I try to leave the room in Vector web, I get the error message “M_UNKNOWN: Room '!cURbafjkfsMDVwdRDQ:matrix.org' does not exist”\n\nSee events past https://vector.im/beta/#/room/!XqBunHwQIXUiqCaoxq:matrix.org/$145936987410rsFHA:polonkai.eu for some discussion about the problem.\n\n(Imported from https://matrix.org/jira/browse/SYN-669)\n\n(Reported by Gergely Polonkai)",
